{"id":278,"vendor_key":"baidu","vendor_name_zh":"百度","title":"[HF] PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR-VL","url":"https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR-VL","source_type":"hf_api","published_at":"2025-10-16T10:14:45+00:00","detected_at":"2026-08-31T02:54:38Z","is_major":true,"trigger_status":"confirmed","official_benchmarks":[],"self_evals":[],"related_papers":[],"summary":{"summary_zh":"百度飞桨团队发布 PaddleOCR-VL，一个面向多语言文档解析的 0.9B 超紧凑视觉语言模型，由 NaViT 风格动态分辨率视觉编码器与 ERNIE-4.5-0.3B 轻量语言模型组成。该模型支持 109 种语言，擅长识别文本、表格、公式、图表等复杂文档元素，在页面级文档解析和元素级识别任务上均达到 SOTA 水平。相比既有流水线式 OCR 方案显著领先，并对顶级 VLM 展现出强竞争力，同时保持极低的资源消耗和快速推理速度，适合真实场景部署。模型以 Apache 2.0 许可开源，并已推出后续版本 PaddleOCR-VL-1.6。","innovations":[{"dimension":"architecture","title":"0.9B超紧凑VLM架构","detail":"将NaViT风格动态高分辨率视觉编码器与轻量级ERNIE-4.5-0.3B语言模型集成，兼顾识别精度与解码效率"},{"dimension":"inference","title":"资源高效推理","detail":"以极小的资源消耗实现快速推理速度，显著优于现有流水线方案，适合实际生产环境部署"}],"progress_magnitude":"major","progress_note":"官方宣称在页面级文档解析与元素级识别上均达到SOTA，显著超越现有流水线方案并与顶级VLM具竞争力，且参数量仅0.9B","predecessor":"PaddleOCR","source_urls":["https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.14528","https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR","https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR-VL"],"confidence":"high","generated_by":"glm_anthro:glm-5.3","generated_at":"2026-09-01T08:43:46Z"},"model_specs":{"params_billions":0.9,"active_params_billions":null,"architecture":"dense","num_experts":null,"context_window":null,"max_output":null,"modalities":["text","image"],"weights":"open","license":"apache-2.0"},"training":{"pretrain_tokens_trillions":null,"data_mix":null,"compute":null,"pretrain_innovations":["NaViT-style动态高分辨率视觉编码器","与ERNIE-4.5-0.3B轻量语言模型集成","0.9B超紧凑VLM架构支持109种语言"],"posttrain_innovations":[],"rl_methods":[]},"pricing":{"has_pricing":false,"input_per_m":null,"output_per_m":null,"cached_in_per_m":null,"currency":"USD","effective_date":null},"content_sources":[{"kind":"primary","source":"https://huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR-VL","chars":12000},{"kind":"paper","source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.